      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.71,
          "en": "So let's output the resources here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.71,
          "end": 6.77,
          "en": "and for that we could use a list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.77,
          "end": 9.36,
          "en": "with v-for on it of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.36,
          "end": 12.62,
          "en": "to loop through all the stored Resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.62,
          "end": 15.75,
          "en": "But as I mentioned at the end of the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.75,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "I rather create a separate component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 20.82,
          "en": "which contains the list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.82,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "and then I'll put all the data in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 25.67,
          "en": "Now you might wonder why,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.67,
          "end": 28.11,
          "en": "why would we create a separate component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.11,
          "end": 31.41,
          "en": "instead of just writing all the markup here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.41,
          "end": 34.09,
          "en": "Well first of all, let me be very clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.09,
          "end": 36.68,
          "en": "you don't need to create a separate component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.68,
          "end": 39.54,
          "en": "it's optional, it's just the idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.54,
          "end": 42.15,
          "en": "behind using Frameworks like Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.15,
          "end": 44.91,
          "en": "If you build bigger and bigger applications,`",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.91,
          "end": 48.2,
          "en": "you could theoretically put all the markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.2,
          "end": 50.52,
          "en": "into just one Vue component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.52,
          "end": 53.943,
          "en": "All the markup could go into the template of App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.92,
          "end": 58.84,
          "en": "but this would become a super huge file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.84,
          "end": 61.82,
          "en": "and maintaining it, editing it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.82,
          "end": 64.56,
          "en": "finding the code you wanna edit right now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.56,
          "end": 66.81,
          "en": "that would all become a nightmare,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.81,
          "end": 71.163,
          "en": "if you have all the markup, all the logic, in one file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.01,
          "end": 74.09,
          "en": "That's why we wanna split our code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.09,
          "end": 76.83,
          "en": "into small reusable pieces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 79.18,
          "en": "Now, there is no hard rule",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.18,
          "end": 81.68,
          "en": "when you should go for a new component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.68,
          "end": 84.02,
          "en": "versus putting the markup and logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.02,
          "end": 85.76,
          "en": "into an existing component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.76,
          "end": 88.35,
          "en": "it's something you will develop over time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.35,
          "end": 89.74,
          "en": "It's a feeling you will get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.74,
          "end": 93.17,
          "en": "and it also comes down to personal preference of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.17,
          "end": 96.06,
          "en": "But things like list items for which you loop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.06,
          "end": 99.28999999999999,
          "en": "are typically candidates for a separate components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.28999999999999,
          "end": 101.52000000000001,
          "en": "and therefore, I'll create a brand new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.52000000000001,
          "end": 102.423,
          "en": "here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.43,
          "end": 106.47999999999999,
          "en": "And that component which I wanna generate here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.47999999999999,
          "end": 110.78,
          "en": "is the Resource Item component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.78,
          "end": 112.1,
          "en": "Now the name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.1,
          "end": 113.84,
          "en": "but of course you wanna describe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.84,
          "end": 116.24000000000001,
          "en": "what you will use this component for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.24000000000001,
          "end": 118.44,
          "en": "And I will use this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.44,
          "end": 121.31,
          "en": "to show a learning resource item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.31,
          "end": 123.66,
          "en": "of course we could therefore also name it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 123.66,
          "end": 126.28,
          "en": "Learning Resource, if you prefer that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 126.28,
          "end": 128.12,
          "en": "and actually I do prefer that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 128.12,
          "end": 131.283,
          "en": "So let's maybe go with that, LearningResource.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.27,
          "end": 135.75,
          "en": "Now, just because I named the file like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.75,
          "end": 137.65,
          "en": "it's not automatically the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 137.65,
          "end": 139.6,
          "en": "by which I will use the component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.6,
          "end": 142.99,
          "en": "but it is considered a good practice to keep that aligned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.99,
          "end": 145.44,
          "en": "So if you named a file Learning Resource,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.44,
          "end": 148.573,
          "en": "you should also name to component Learning Resource later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 150.06,
          "end": 152.47,
          "en": "Now, I don't wanna store this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.47,
          "end": 154.6,
          "en": "in a components folder like this though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 154.6,
          "end": 156.82999999999998,
          "en": "we're going to add more components later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.82999999999998,
          "end": 160.97,
          "en": "and to keep my code organized and keep the files organized,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.97,
          "end": 162.86,
          "en": "I'll create a subfolder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.86,
          "end": 167.66,
          "en": "and I'll name it, resources or learning-resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167.66,
          "end": 170.16,
          "en": "because I wanna store all the learning resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 170.16,
          "end": 172.82999999999998,
          "en": "related components in that subfolder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.82999999999998,
          "end": 174.19,
          "en": "So instead of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 174.19,
          "end": 176.703,
          "en": "and they're in the Learning Resources folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 178.15,
          "end": 180.22,
          "en": "And then in App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.22,
          "end": 183.05,
          "en": "I wanna import this newly created component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 183.05,
          "end": 186.12,
          "en": "It's still empty, but we're going to change this soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.12,
          "end": 188.36,
          "en": "So let's import the LearningResource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.36,
          "end": 193.36,
          "en": "from './components/learning-resources/LearningResource.vue'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.59,
          "end": 198.503,
          "en": "that's the file we just created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 199.77,
          "end": 203.15,
          "en": "And with that import added here in App.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.15,
          "end": 207.1,
          "en": "we can add the components option to our object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.1,
          "end": 209.85,
          "en": "and register Learning Resource like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.85,
          "end": 211.42000000000002,
          "en": "this is how you learned it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.42000000000002,
          "end": 215.05,
          "en": "You could also give it another key separately",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 215.05,
          "end": 218.06,
          "en": "or the same key which will be assumed anyways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.06,
          "end": 219.67000000000002,
          "en": "but there is no need to do so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.67000000000002,
          "end": 221.65,
          "en": "you can just register it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.65,
          "end": 224.44,
          "en": "and thanks to this modern JavaScript Syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 224.44,
          "end": 227.13,
          "en": "This is automatically expanded to this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.13,
          "end": 229.57,
          "en": "and that in turn will then tell Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 229.57,
          "end": 231.3,
          "en": "that you want to be able to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 231.3,
          "end": 234.97,
          "en": "the Learning Resource component by using this tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 234.97,
          "end": 237.94,
          "en": "or the kebab-case version of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 237.94,
          "end": 240.913,
          "en": "But that's all something I covered in the last modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 241.9,
          "end": 244.46,
          "en": "So now we've got the learning resource imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 244.46,
          "end": 248.11,
          "en": "and now here I will output learning resource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 248.11,
          "end": 251.44,
          "en": "and I'm a fan of this Kebab-case for my elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 251.44,
          "end": 254.34,
          "en": "so I will use it and I would put it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 254.34,
          "end": 256.16,
          "en": "but of course not just once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.16,
          "end": 257.97,
          "en": "but instead with v-for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 257.97,
          "end": 261,
          "en": "I will loop through my stored Resources",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 261,
          "end": 264.29,
          "en": "and create one learning resource component instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 264.29,
          "end": 267.23,
          "en": "per item in my stored Resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 267.23,
          "end": 269.85,
          "en": "So in this case, we have two stored Resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 269.85,
          "end": 272.35,
          "en": "and that simply means that we're going to create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 272.35,
          "end": 275.573,
          "en": "two learning resource instances with v-for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 277.82,
          "end": 281.18,
          "en": "For that we can loop through the stored Resources like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 281.18,
          "end": 283.527,
          "en": "with res in storedResources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 284.38,
          "end": 287.4,
          "en": "and we should bind the key prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 287.4,
          "end": 291.17,
          "en": "which Vue wants, in this case to res.id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 291.17,
          "end": 294,
          "en": "because every resource which I extract",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 294,
          "end": 298.26,
          "en": "into the res variable here has an id field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 298.26,
          "end": 300.88,
          "en": "and that id is guaranteed to be unique,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 300.88,
          "end": 302.363,
          "en": "so it's a perfect key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 304.23,
          "end": 307.23,
          "en": "With that we're going to create multiple learning resources,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 307.23,
          "end": 309.27,
          "en": "and that means that we can now go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 309.27,
          "end": 313.2,
          "en": "to the LearningResource.vue file and add a template there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 313.2,
          "end": 315.23,
          "en": "because ultimately we want to be able to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 315.23,
          "end": 317.29,
          "en": "output something there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 317.29,
          "end": 321.66,
          "en": "So in this template, I will now output a list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 321.66,
          "end": 325.74,
          "en": "opening and closing text and inside of the list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 325.74,
          "end": 327.383,
          "en": "I want to have my content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 328.29,
          "end": 332.073,
          "en": "And here indeed I want to have a div inside of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 332.94,
          "end": 335.093,
          "en": "which that in turn holds a header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 335.94,
          "end": 339.07,
          "en": "And in that header, I want to have an h3 tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 339.07,
          "end": 343.27,
          "en": "which outputs the title later, and next to that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 343.27,
          "end": 345.86,
          "en": "so in the same row you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 345.86,
          "end": 349.8,
          "en": "I want to have a button which allows us to delete this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 349.8,
          "end": 353.31,
          "en": "Now as a side note, I'm aware that I challenged you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 353.31,
          "end": 356.84000000000003,
          "en": "to go ahead and create your own component with a list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 356.84000000000003,
          "end": 360.07,
          "en": "and I'm fully aware that you probably did not create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 360.07,
          "end": 362.32,
          "en": "this markup, and that's fine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 362.32,
          "end": 364.81,
          "en": "you can now create it together with me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 364.81,
          "end": 368.35,
          "en": "I just wanted you to also practice creating and registering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 368.35,
          "end": 370.19,
          "en": "and using components on your own,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 370.19,
          "end": 371.66,
          "en": "and you hopefully did that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 371.66,
          "end": 373.5,
          "en": "and you hopefully succeeded there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 373.5,
          "end": 376.13,
          "en": "if not, we're doing it together now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 376.13,
          "end": 377.93,
          "en": "So we get the header, we get the h3 tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 377.93,
          "end": 380.68,
          "en": "we got the button, and it's all in that div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 380.68,
